<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:00:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>随着对人工智能行业前景的质疑不断增多，全球科技股的抛售没有显示出停止的迹象，投资者转向债券寻求安全。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Swoon as AI Fears Spur Rush to Treasuries: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着人工智能担忧加剧，CoreWeave 和 Nvidia 信用风险创下新高</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-nvidia-credit-risk-hit-fresh-highs-as-ai-fears-mount</link><description>CoreWeave Inc. 和 Nvidia Corp. 的信用风险指标周三创下历史新高，同时，随着华尔街对科技行业为人工智能融资而创纪录的借贷越来越担忧，人们的担忧情绪再次达到 3 月份的水平。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-nvidia-credit-risk-hit-fresh-highs-as-ai-fears-mount'&gt;随着人工智能担忧加剧，CoreWeave 和 Nvidia 信用风险创下新高&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：CoreWeave, Nvidia Credit Risk Hit Fresh Highs as AI Fears Mount&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-nvidia-credit-risk-hit-fresh-highs-as-ai-fears-mount</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:44:02 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Anthropic 首次公开募股后的困境与 SpaceX 的早期形成鲜明对比</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/anthropic-s-post-ipo-struggles-contrast-with-spacex-s-early-days</link><description>Anthropic PBC 正在经历比 SpaceX 更艰难的上市进程，在这家克劳德开发商明年初首次作为上市公司发布报告之前，一系列市场和技术因素可能会拖累其股票表现。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/anthropic-s-post-ipo-struggles-contrast-with-spacex-s-early-days'&gt;Anthropic 首次公开募股后的困境与 SpaceX 的早期形成鲜明对比&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Anthropic’s Post-IPO Struggles Contrast With SpaceX’s Early Days&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/anthropic-s-post-ipo-struggles-contrast-with-spacex-s-early-days</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:45:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</link><description>由于科技股再度下跌，削弱了投资者对风险资产的兴趣，美国国债周三全线上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment'&gt;科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasury Yields Sink to Two-Month Low as Stocks Rout Intensifies&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:49:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>秘鲁力争在年底前解决非正式采矿纠纷</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/peru-races-to-resolve-informal-mining-fight-by-year-end-deadline</link><description>秘鲁正在竞相在年底截止日期前彻底修改管理数以万计的非正规采矿者的规定，政府警告说，否则可能会在一夜之间将他们推向非法状态。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/peru-races-to-resolve-informal-mining-fight-by-year-end-deadline'&gt;秘鲁力争在年底前解决非正式采矿纠纷&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Peru Races to Resolve Informal Mining Fight by Year-End Deadline&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/peru-races-to-resolve-informal-mining-fight-by-year-end-deadline</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:55:18 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>